# CODEOWNERS — required review by the owning team on every PR (branch protection enforces this).
# Teams are placeholders (org not yet created); replace with real GitHub teams at P0.1 org setup.
# Every path in the monorepo has an explicit owner — no unowned code.

# Default — platform team owns anything not otherwise claimed
