/infrastructure/monitoring/         @nexus-commerce-os/sre
/infrastructure/security/           @nexus-commerce-os/cloud-security
/infrastructure/github/             @nexus-commerce-os/devsecops
/.github/                           @nexus-commerce-os/devsecops @nexus-commerce-os/platform

# Apps & services (scaffold owners; feature teams added at their phase)
